  - File filter: cho ph├⌐p PDF, DOC, DOCX, JPG, JPEG, PNG, XLS, XLSX
  - Size limit: 10MB (configurable via env)
- Export `upload` middleware (single file field name: 'file')

### src/controllers/fileController.js
- `uploadFile`: 
  - Nhß║¡n file tß╗½ multer
